WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.170
- Well, Michelle, you say
Maximus has had to deal

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.790
with a lot of different reactions

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.383
as a black male dancer, right?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:09.160
- Yes, we're a military family

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:11.570
and Maximus physically
lives five different places

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.860
and he's also been to five
different dance studios.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.210
And those dancers are white females and,

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.260
Maximus is obviously neither of those.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.840
So often when he goes
to a new dance studio,

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.630
he'll come home sad because he says

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.440
no one's talked to talks to him

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.670
and he sits in the corner by himself.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.450
But then, once maximums finally

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.230
does some different dance moves

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.470
and people see that he's actually

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.960
just as passionate
about dance as they are,

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:35.550
then they embrace him,

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.720
and then he becomes friends and--

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.170
- Look at him!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:39.663
You get it, Maximus!

00:00:40.637 --> 00:00:41.990
- This is our house all day, every day.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.540
- I swear to God, if I could do that,

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:44.787
I'd be doing it right now.

00:00:44.787 --> 00:00:45.620
(laughter)

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:47.270
- Hey, if you could do that

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.852
that's exactly how they'd
take you to the hospital.

00:00:49.852 --> 00:00:51.010
(laughter)

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.343
- I'd be like, stuck.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.120
Well, Maximus, you say
you wanna be a role model

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.053
to other young dancers, right?

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:03.707
- Definitely, so one
time somebody was like,

00:01:03.707 --> 00:01:04.990
"Oh, boys don't dance."

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.750
And I was like, "Yes, they do."

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:10.340
And so I think that all boys should dance,

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:12.710
including you, Terry.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.649
(laughter)

